From c6bac46d83c66a29bf5e81eee345085bc446dee4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yan Markman <ymarkman@marvell.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 17:34:30 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/1] orchagent: gearbox for shared phy system-port topology

Add to Gearbox supporting for the Marvell-Alaska
shared multilane host_side PHY-MAC interface topology.
Fix SAI_PORT_ATTR_SPEED speed for this topology.

CURRENT topology:
each outbound port has single/separated
system_lanes and line_lanes (1x1 or 4x4 or 8x8).

line port0 >-PHY--1x1--Serdes/MAC

ADDED topology:
shared system lane map where multiple outbound 1_lane ports
refer the same shared system_lane LIST 8x1
(multiple logical ports over one host-side lane bundle).

line port0 -------\                    Ethernet0
      ...  >-PHY-<01234567>-8x1--Serdes/MAC
line port7 -------------/              Ethernet7

Signed-off-by: Yan Markman <ymarkman@marvell.com>
